  "prefLabel": "Mil 202.07 Request for Information or Documents",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mil 202.07 Request for Information or Documents. Each party shall attempt in good faith to make complete and timely response to requests for the voluntary production of information or documents relevant to the hearing.\n\nSource. #7529, eff 7-12-01",
